menuconfig LIBUKRANDOM_CLODDY
	bool "Cloddy comm-page seeded randomness"
	depends on KVM_VMM_CLODDY && LIBUKRANDOM
	select LIBUKBOOT
	help
		Seeds Unikraft's CSPRNG from the 32-byte entropy field in the
		cloddy-vmm comm page (GPA 0x9000). Registered as an early-tab
		driver at a priority before the LCPU driver so that, when the
		comm page is present and valid, cloddy-supplied entropy is used
		as the CSPRNG seed. When the comm page is absent (e.g. running
		under a different VMM), this driver returns early and the LCPU
		driver registers the fallback.

